{
  "version": 1,
  "mappingRevision": 1,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "intro-1",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Plip—one silver ripple starts small.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-2",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Follow it past reef and shore; watch the blue grow wide.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-A",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "A - Angelfish! Tall fins fan; flat body turns | slipping through coral branches where reef light gleams.",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-B",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "B ... B ... Buoy! Bob, bob, bright on blue | anchored in place, a floating marker for boats.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-C",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "C is for Coral. Tiny animals, side by side | hard skeletons can build reefs where little swimmers hide.",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-D",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "D? Dock! Shore meets boat | boats tie up, load up, rocking with the tide.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-E",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "Here comes E with Eel. Long fish, no legs | bend through a rocky gap, wave after wave.",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-F",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "F - Fish! Fin flick, tail swish | gills take oxygen from water as it swims.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-G",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "G ... G ... Grouper! Stout in reef shade | broad mouth waiting by a ledge.",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-H",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "H is for Harbor. Waves grow mild behind shelter | boats find calmer water to rest in.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-2-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-2",
      "text": "Splash-splash! Ride the ripple with me,",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-2-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-2",
      "text": "Ocean letters, A to Z!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-I",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "I? Island! Land in a ring of blue | one still shape with moving water all around.",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-J",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "J - Jetty! Built out from shore | rock, concrete, or timber reaches into the water.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-K",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "Kayak - that's K. Narrow boat, double-bladed paddle | left stroke, right stroke, glide and turn.",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-L",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "L ... L ... Lobster! Step-step on the seafloor | long antennae feel the way ahead.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-M",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "M is for Mussel. Shell shuts tight | silky threads hold fast when the tide pulls by.",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-N",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "N? Narwhal! Cold Arctic blue | that spiral tusk is really one very long tooth.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-O",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "O - Octopus! Eight arms feel and grip | soft body squeezes through a narrow gap.",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-P",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "P - Pelican! Skim, dip, scoop | throat pouch catches fish, then lets the water drain.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-4-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-4",
      "text": "Splash-splash! Ride the ripple with me,",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-4-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-4",
      "text": "Ocean letters, A to Z!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Q",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Q ... Q ... Quahog! Say KOH-hog | hard-shell clam tucked in coastal sand or mud.",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-R",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "R is for Ray. Wide fins ripple like wings | gliding low like a shadow over sand.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-S",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "S? Seahorse! Upright, tiny fin flutter | curled tail grips seagrass when the current pulls.",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-T",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "T - Turtle! In the sea, broad flippers sweep | steady strokes through open water.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-U",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "U - Undersea Cave! Rock opens under waves | a dark saltwater hollow below the light.",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-V",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "V ... V ... Violet Sea Snail! Tiny purple-blue | hanging from a bubble raft at the surface.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-W",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "W is for Whale. Deep below, then up for air | one huge breath at the surface, then down again.",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-X",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "X? X-ray Tetra! Freshwater visitor, not sea | translucent body lets some bones partly show.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-6-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-6",
      "text": "Splash-splash! Ride the ripple with me,",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-6-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-6",
      "text": "Ocean letters, A to Z!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Y",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Y - Yellowfin Tuna! Yellow finlets flash | streamlined body slices through open blue.",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Z",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Z ... Z ... Zooplankton! Tiny drifters ride the flow | current carries our last letter where the first ripple goes.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "interlude-1",
      "sectionId": "mid-interlude",
      "text": "The ripple turns. I call the letter; you bring the ocean word back.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-A",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "A ... Angelfish! Tall fins—fan and glide.",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-B",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "B - what bobs? ... Buoy! Bob one hand up and down.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-C",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "C - reef builder? ... Coral! Open fingers like branches.",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-D",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "D at the shore ... Dock! One flat arm makes the platform.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-E",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "E - long and bendy ... Eel! Wave one hand side to side.",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-F",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "F - fin flick, tail swish ... Fish! Swish one hand once.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-G",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "G in reef shade ... Grouper! Make one slow glide.",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-H",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "H - calmer water ... Harbor! Curve both hands into a bay.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-2-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-2",
      "text": "Splash-splash! Ride the ripple with me,",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-2-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-2",
      "text": "Ocean letters, A to Z!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-I",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "Water all around - I? ... Island! Circle one still fist.",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-J",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "J reaches out ... Jetty! Slide one flat hand outward.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-K",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "K - double paddle ... Kayak! Paddle left, then right.",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-L",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "L - seafloor walker ... Lobster! Walk two fingers.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-M",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "M - shell shuts tight ... Mussel! Close two palms.",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-N",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "N - spiral tooth ... Narwhal! Trace one spiral.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-O",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Eight arms - O? ... Octopus! Wiggle both hands.",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-P",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "P - bill and pouch ... Pelican! Scoop, then lift.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-4-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-4",
      "text": "Splash-splash! Ride the ripple with me,",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-4-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-4",
      "text": "Ocean letters, A to Z!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Q",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "Q ... Quahog! KOH-hog—close two palms like a clam.",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-R",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "R - wide fins over sand ... Ray! Glide hands wide.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-S",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "S - upright, curled tail ... Seahorse! Curl one finger.",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-T",
      "sectionId": "r2-q-t",
      "text": "T - shell and flippers ... Turtle! Make a shell, then sweep.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-U",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "U - dark hollow under waves ... Undersea Cave! Arch both hands.",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-V",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "V - bubble raft ... Violet Sea Snail! Spiral, then float.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-W",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "Who rises for air? W ... Whale! Lift, breathe, glide down.",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-X",
      "sectionId": "r2-u-x",
      "text": "X - freshwater visitor ... X-ray Tetra! Small fish glide—freshwater is home.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Y",
      "sectionId": "r2-y-z",
      "text": "Y - yellow finlets ... Yellowfin Tuna! Sweep fast and smooth.",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-Z",
      "sectionId": "r2-y-z",
      "text": "Z - tiny drifters ... Zooplankton! Let fingertips ride the flow.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-7-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-7",
      "text": "Splash-splash! Ride the ripple with me,",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-7-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-7",
      "text": "Ocean letters, A to Z!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "outro-1",
      "sectionId": "outro",
      "text": "One last silver ripple touches the shore.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "outro-2",
      "sectionId": "outro",
      "text": "A to Z grows quiet; the water moves once more.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    }
  ]
}
